  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-315cb001-8f34-49a2-9189-f9d1db5861e6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e70ceb6-1364-4cc9-8de2-221a96dc16d1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-44aa75f1-1e9e-4dad-9192-e23e9dd30f2e\">서울에 프리미엄 실버타운을 하려는 대표님이 계세요. 2주 전에 미팅을 다녀왔고, 지난주에 어떻게 할지와 / 비용 을 안내드렸어요. 그랬더니 오늘 마침 하고 싶다고 오셨더라구요. 이번주에 미팅을 가야해서 미팅 하기 전에, 미리 여기에 정리해봅니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d8e92ff-88eb-407e-902a-f4ff7d90d859\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-36c9f315-8a18-4d18-9218-55ddad077075\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-315cb001-8f34-49a2-9189-f9d1db5861e6\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-382234cc-408e-46ee-9a90-7455f4ba60ae\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:370px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-382234cc-408e-46ee-9a90-7455f4ba60ae\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA5MjNfNzAg/MDAxNzU4NTkzMDE5NDM5.Ekhvmc5YCsrqwBXZwjt2urwnP1Cb8NlEOCiuNTdQjuAg.jpagZeg0srvfzy2CjRS13oHcsod345_XoIVnVG9CmWEg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"370\", \"originalHeight\" : \"190\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA5MjNfNzAg/MDAxNzU4NTkzMDE5NDM5.Ekhvmc5YCsrqwBXZwjt2urwnP1Cb8NlEOCiuNTdQjuAg.jpagZeg0srvfzy2CjRS13oHcsod345_XoIVnVG9CmWEg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-382234cc-408e-46ee-9a90-7455f4ba60ae\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\", \"ai\": \"false\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-0be7b908-6e1b-44e4-9f4f-04302f064252\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ca1c9da4-2c45-41b0-8a1b-e182509fa43c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fb496d0f-9827-4079-99e6-ff13c08c5520\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9619b355-2f88-4399-a47d-2b6dcd683cec\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e26c200c-2178-48fa-a9a4-673ed6d1eb11\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-be3ad57f-4a59-457e-a436-0cde78c40cce\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1b090c5b-5266-4d8d-90bd-82acb97cb9b0\">&lt;클라이언트 요구사항&gt;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4ea11663-ac55-494f-92e6-f72e32a84a3c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3873ff6a-6a03-4d4e-b59f-be1abb782dae\">1. 다음달에 모델하우스 오픈 예정 &#x3D;&gt; 모델하우스 방문자 증가</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cd61d182-eda3-4903-b78d-a6bb91c01523\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3f77e41a-e508-4d3b-be9b-bbaecf3419d9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b98eb431-0806-46c0-b387-9e371f54025a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8e96e004-a947-4ad8-9132-894106c86f22\">2. 6개월 후에 착공 시작 &#x3D;&gt; 착공전 입주 예정 고객 선계약</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3f8ade59-934e-4e0f-9d69-ae20aefedaf3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2058d5a7-6a6e-4755-81b9-0885eeb6fde4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-59d3e46e-fa80-4eac-bb4a-bae9a33c4c90\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8711326c-0004-4399-a340-5e92c1874048\">사실 여기는 마케팅 적으로는 &quot;어떻게 해야겠다&quot; 가 바로 그려졌어요. 첫 미팅 때부터 느낌은 왔고, 실제로 찾아봤을때도 레퍼런스도 많이 보였구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75e9b516-5d21-4690-b50e-7c9d85c2b73f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-67fa0f5b-ebdb-4069-9529-23eaf6c5defe\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5379827a-3a2f-4319-bb2a-aadf1a6eec32\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-daf275f6-d0f0-4f92-a302-0afa7998cb44\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4c919fde-d60e-4332-909a-aba76830e3bf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-52ef89ab-22f4-487d-bf38-0431d302f8dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1c042842-b188-4bcb-9316-7bfa014a33bf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a7c0892e-e41a-4d54-a7fb-59a54efb94d0\">&lt;예시 조감도&gt;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-0be7b908-6e1b-44e4-9f4f-04302f064252\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-95c0298c-73ec-43da-a283-3220c2b891bd\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:568px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-95c0298c-73ec-43da-a283-3220c2b891bd\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA5MjNfMjcw/MDAxNzU4NTkxMDQwNDE4.Ou2HXpo2_VRIchCGfssZHbBIT-IjRPblHR34zZFQvfsg.TIMOegbtjPNTa8D9PkiIESccZlc1M5mYYhpBEQoRNEog.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"568\", \"originalHeight\" : \"492\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA5MjNfMjcw/MDAxNzU4NTkxMDQwNDE4.Ou2HXpo2_VRIchCGfssZHbBIT-IjRPblHR34zZFQvfsg.TIMOegbtjPNTa8D9PkiIESccZlc1M5mYYhpBEQoRNEog.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-95c0298c-73ec-43da-a283-3220c2b891bd\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\", \"ai\": \"false\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ad1019ad-8a08-4767-ac44-507c469b4a49\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3ab22b9f-9e5d-4b32-8af4-39d9b9afd8d9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-39922c39-8733-4ee6-bb05-3ef868089472\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a26c9b07-6190-403a-9d76-662a554faeed\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2fa909a6-4c98-49f8-b303-8170dd18d5a2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ff105172-0eaa-4976-98fd-14cc8d35964d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a8c5690a-843b-4cc6-a009-b66b44f4a14a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b3de234a-cc49-41e0-a1a4-0c28d5b18338\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4bf1fc34-6b9c-4e66-81e5-3d8e7cd69707\">일단 기본 계획은 2단계 입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-187c3eba-d9bc-431d-b30d-c768f6bd2731\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c849f890-b425-4a7d-a40a-1dd0656ac5e4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-49854feb-37df-43c4-a487-e1cbf3d755c0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-341f9fa1-5609-41b8-9321-e6c3bd241477\">1. 실버타운에 관심있는 사람 모은다 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-393b4b94-730b-41a0-a839-cac67bde3cef\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4628b332-1ae7-419d-90e5-679055936fb1\">2. 우리 준공까지 붙잡아 둔다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f70e4d86-6867-42c0-ac3e-0947d5f69d51\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a1547495-164c-4dc6-8c37-da4b0a3f6f28\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c45215e6-d124-4349-859c-5d235cd8dbd3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-26925382-cd5b-4a59-8c19-22e78cb4c545\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d146455-8aac-417d-99a5-277e74e8904f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7d2ac165-7b74-4908-9e97-718fa8bd0d04\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5e5dbca0-a0a6-4585-821a-9de179795873\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fce469f1-eb6d-4cd5-b99a-6d2e63c15ca3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-05d6aff4-ba0c-45ee-9291-4cd7481f9104\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-98913a83-226f-4ef3-98b4-8b96a382268e\">&lt;관심 있는 사람 모으기&gt;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-494ad97c-452c-49a1-b39e-c1b751a2c594\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-81231310-c847-42c6-b01b-dfd47a815040\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c5d57b74-c85f-457b-9787-2b1846475ded\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c2fe6e36-3d92-40b7-a342-e604ac97be40\">여기서 핵심은 실버타운에 대한 인식을 전환하는 것입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9aeb7576-0ae0-422d-b175-114eb50edffd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d8e13c00-42c8-4c5f-a6d4-6862db34301d\">&quot;나이들어서 가는 곳 &#x3D;&gt; 빨리 가서 쉬고 싶은 곳&quot; 으로 &#x3D;&gt; 이거는 하기 쉽다고 생각했어요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b2430837-435d-4293-a19b-f310f9deefa6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1394cc89-3b56-4ee3-9a76-8599cbc8378d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-28e17db9-dcfc-4a3c-9602-ff0558b398db\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b5ad0b2e-6ff6-4b24-9bcb-27043724487e\">여기는 서울 중심가에 있는 프리미엄 실버타운이거든요. (실제 수요 조사를 하셨는데, 실버타운에서 가장 중요학 여기는게 위치라고 하더라구요. 그래서 일부로 위치를 그렇게 잡으셨데요)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-004f95d5-a2a1-4203-ba1a-911b48971ef8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d7bf6f31-d1ca-405b-8e93-194f915b912b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7b52209c-6d37-44e8-a7ae-ba1fb60fedc0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9eb3f74d-6cbb-4632-8c9e-049059f69ff7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d204d11e-9180-4c35-84a6-5f4908caafbb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8d653010-94cb-4754-94e1-6571e5b6c5f3\">이걸 컨텐츠적으로 녹이려면,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f93fa67e-54dd-483c-af85-2fa91f9440f4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-15e62d44-29b8-43db-8368-d5a0a83c0f80\">- 다른 실버타운 리뷰하기 &#x3D;&gt; 여기서 배울점 공부하는 모습 보이기</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f3a1b284-7f15-495b-8229-36f1ec79c7af\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f0be0b93-e904-4e5a-bb97-4bede9bb3837\">- 기존 실버타운의 문제점 정보성 컨텐츠 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-617c3113-779d-469d-9a3b-8163a0df25c5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5bc52737-c69b-4672-8a81-6924bd45b489\">- 실버타운 입주자 인터뷰 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5937975b-4931-47ea-9797-388255813cea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9f909ea5-bb3c-46a3-b62c-48de3eed1831\">등등</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e761fa8-95a5-4178-8e01-03fa3990dda1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-99cb1777-0caa-4df8-a824-c4e9c52103be\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e1360021-3cd9-448d-b5f0-e257df06f18e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-357c5948-276e-4ccc-8327-4317e6924132\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f56ec8a0-79e3-4683-95c4-545b11bd47ff\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fed8edee-52a5-43a4-988a-1de0301b8e87\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6e41d32e-c6c7-4175-b39b-8e4a65690e50\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c741e324-3165-48fc-afa5-2e27111491f9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-991f85b2-08ff-462b-b10c-ceb7afb1cdcf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-00cc91e3-72b6-4f4e-b7a0-8a429700ab72\">&lt;우리 고객으로 만들기&gt;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b3020473-28a4-426a-8237-c495799be42e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-260b86e6-a048-43e5-8ac4-ee2040372b02\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dc2e5e0e-668d-42c8-b2d6-cd5823164504\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4c23e53f-20e4-4450-b21d-6dc99b977e58\">요즘에는 유튜브 구독자가 늘어난다고해서 내 고객이 되는건 아니기 때문에, 모아둘 곳이 있어야 합니다. 특히나 이렇게 오픈 전이거나 주기가 긴 업종(재구매 기간이 최소 1년 이상, 예를들어 공인중개사 사무소나 성형외과 등)들은 더 모아둬야 해요. 그리고 우리가 필요할때까지 그 사람들을 붙들어 둬야죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eea95854-4f54-474e-9533-3e1af872789a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fa4dab1f-8df1-4d82-9cd5-de8c7870348a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-538a0802-848d-4674-95d6-d82a417f6102\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-224da6a8-e8b7-4d06-84b0-5d4effc49103\">제가 이렇게 카페 하는 것 처럼요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1cab7f11-c3df-497c-aa92-e6bc0a0dba38\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-92756cc5-f0ba-4090-855d-611310da8241\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70d01485-a6e8-426b-b160-000f70bd7cc4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bf6e12f0-0fb2-4e1c-aba4-5c1e8d71ebad\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-54508add-8f11-44bc-8040-7083f3ddd7d4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ce756f8c-5969-480c-9ebf-5c4d2815cf28\">컨텐츠 적으로는 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8ef6eef4-9154-4987-b0ac-d5f6ff0f7d8e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fb1eccdf-c30a-41cc-8200-08c0bb98ee72\">- 우리 실버타운 건축 현장 계속 보이기 &#x3D;&gt; 창업과정처럼 우리가 어떤 노력을 하는지 보이기</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a19e68f7-2806-4f45-a26f-ba6a4525b088\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8d64de2c-44ab-4a2d-8fcc-650578b732ff\">- 본 실버타운 레퍼런스한 일본 실버타운 사례 보여주기 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f2c98a48-0fc8-454b-a8f6-b70a8489bdfd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3230abf5-2a48-4aa9-b245-c930effa6496\">등등 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-31108b4f-41af-4601-b450-531945e44fca\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7fe2a2ee-eaec-41f5-b15a-b8f38b6c7268\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a836753-b350-41b7-9e30-78e6be2b2a94\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b576db90-0280-45a2-8b6c-8ec02a489fbf\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f2beeaca-4279-4523-9b92-5fd172bda7b3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-13f7d6c6-c59b-4daf-bcc6-bcadc3738651\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-939afe01-4a30-4f66-885c-509c449fcb5e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5ec4b672-cb98-4cc7-8b53-8cd006bdb376\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-505f3791-a3a4-404f-9ea2-b0dbe39fb644\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-be47b112-51a9-49cd-badc-dbfccead91d2\">시작은 유튜브부터 하게 될것 같구요. 결국엔 인스타 / 블로그 등 다 할 예정입니다. 그럼 미팅하고 또 알려드릴게요!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-ad1019ad-8a08-4767-ac44-507c469b4a49\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
